<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">학기인 경우는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">학점 이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">건축학전공은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">학년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -34.2pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; margin-left: 34.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-U