: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">별 추천인원 배정 현황 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">붙임</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -20pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; margin-left: 20pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">8. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">장학생 선발 절차</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -33.7pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; margin-left: 33.7pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">학생은 연구봉사장학생 신청서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">[</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">별첨 서식 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2]</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">를 작성하여 연구과제교수 및 학부장의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">추천을 받아 해당학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">행정실로 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -33.2pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; margin-left: 33.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">장은 학부 자체 심사를 거쳐 장학생을 선발</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">학생처로 추천명단 및 신청서를</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">공문으로 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -33.9pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; margin-left: 1.7em; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">학생처는 학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">추천 순으로 배정된 인원을 장학생으로 선발하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">미달인원이 있을시 후보자 중에서 직전학기 이수학점과 평점평균이 높은 순으로 장학생을 선발하여 해당 학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">로 통보</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -81.3pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; margin-left: 81.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">9. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">의무사항 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">장학생으로 선발된 학생은 연구참여기간 종료 후 참여 결과보고서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">별지 서식 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3]</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">를 제출하여야 한다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. (1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">일까지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -19.5pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; margin-left: 19.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">10. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">장학생 추천시 유의사항 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">교수 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">인당 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">과제이내 지원</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
